# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Exception: app/release-keystore.jks is intentionally committed public.
# This project has no Play Store distribution; GitHub Release updates only
# need a signature that stays consistent across build machines. The owner
# explicitly accepted that anyone with this key can produce a signature-
# matching "update" — see README.md's Signing section before reusing this
# pattern on a project with real adversaries or Play Store distribution.
!app/release-keystore.jks
